; ScreenKit Android Open Accessory (Google AOA 18D1:2D00 / 2D01) → WinUSB
; 配件重枚举后 Windows 才能被 LibUsb 打开。pnputil /add-driver 安装（需管理员）。

[Version]
Signature = "$WINDOWS NT$"
Class = USBDevice
ClassGuid = {88BAE032-5A81-49f0-BC3D-A4FF138216D6}
Provider = %Mfg%
DriverVer = 09/24/2026,1.0.0.0
PnpLockdown = 1

[Manufacturer]
%Mfg% = Std,NTamd64

[Std.NTamd64]
%DevName% = USB_Install, USB\VID_18D1&PID_2D00
%DevName% = USB_Install, USB\VID_18D1&PID_2D01

[USB_Install]
Include = winusb.inf
Needs = WINUSB.NT

[USB_Install.Services]
Include = winusb.inf
Needs = WINUSB.NT.Services

[USB_Install.HW]
AddReg = Dev_AddReg

[Dev_AddReg]
HKR,,DeviceInterfaceGUIDs,0x10000,"{dee824ef-729b-4a0e-9c14-b7117d33a817}"

[Strings]
Mfg = "ScreenKit"
DevName = "Android USB Accessory (ScreenKit)"
